WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.704
Static typing, no hints

00:13.704 --> 00:34.776
Goal: types you never write

00:34.776 --> 01:07.478
Code: inferred, not written

01:07.478 --> 01:24.931
Run: caught before it runs

01:24.931 --> 02:13.843
Code: a real package

02:13.843 --> 02:56.621
Code: effects, not exceptions

02:56.621 --> 03:57.830
Run: checked against CPython

03:57.830 --> 04:17.479
Change it: mix two types

04:17.479 --> 04:50.622
Try it
